{"seq":1,"slug":"simd-selection-vector-model","title":"SIMD 通路与选择向量：批处理数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/column-operators-simd/simd-selection-vector-model","wordCount":2632,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"simd-通路与选择向量-批处理数据模型\">SIMD 通路与选择向量：批处理数据模型</h1><p>一次 <code>WHERE price &gt; 100 AND region = &#39;EU&#39;</code> 的过滤，在火山模型里是逐行调用谓词函数、逐行返回布尔值；而在向量化引擎里，它变成一条固定的数据通路：定长向量进、SIMD 比较、掩码压缩成索引列表、下游按索引列表读列。这条通路能否跑满内存带宽，取决于两个设计常量——<strong>批大小（batch size）</strong> 与 <strong>选择向量（selection vector）</strong>。本文把这两者当作数据结构而非技巧来拆解，解释 X100 为什么选一千行量级的向量、DuckDB 为什么把默认向量大小定为 2048、以及选择向量如何让「过滤」从一趟计算变成一张可延迟兑现的索引清单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>批处理模型把「一行」这一执行单位替换为「一批同类型值的定长向量」。算子不再是 <code>next() -&gt; Tuple</code>，而是 <code>next() -&gt; VectorBatch</code>：一次调用处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 行，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 就是批大小。MonetDB/X100 在 2005 年的 CIDR 论文里首次系统化这一模型（Boncz、Zukowski、Nes，《MonetDB/X100: Hyper-Pipelining Query Execution》，CIDR 2005），用约一千个值的向量作 CPU 与列存之间的传输单位，理由是向量恰好能在循环体内完全装入缓存，同时摊薄逐行解释开销。</p>\n<p><strong>选择向量</strong>是这一模型的第二个原语。过滤算子不搬移数据，只输出一个整数索引数组：<code>sel = [3, 7, 8, 11, ...]</code>，语义是「这批里第 3、7、8、11 行存活」。下游算子拿到 <code>(向量, sel)</code> 二元组，按需读取。DuckDB 用 <code>SelectionVector</code> 表达它，内部是 <code>sel_t</code>（即 <code>uint32_t</code>）指针加 <code>count</code>，容量上界为 <code>MAX_VECTOR_SIZE</code>（2048），类型定义见 DuckDB 源码 <code>src/include/duckdb/common/types/selection_vector.hpp</code>。选择向量是密集数组而非位图——压缩与遍历都友好。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[列式数据块&lt;br/&gt;n 行定长向量] --&gt; B[比较算子&lt;br/&gt;SIMD 比较生成位掩码]&#10;  B --&gt; C[掩码转索引&lt;br/&gt;压缩 compact]&#10;  C --&gt; D[选择向量 sel&lt;br/&gt;存活行下标密集数组]&#10;  D --&gt; E[下游算子&lt;br/&gt;按 sel 读列]&#10;  E --&gt; F[延迟物化&lt;br/&gt;需要时才按 sel 抓列]&#10;  D --&gt; G[继续合并&lt;br/&gt;AND 取交集 / OR 取并集]\">flowchart TD\n  A[列式数据块&lt;br/&gt;n 行定长向量] --&gt; B[比较算子&lt;br/&gt;SIMD 比较生成位掩码]\n  B --&gt; C[掩码转索引&lt;br/&gt;压缩 compact]\n  C --&gt; D[选择向量 sel&lt;br/&gt;存活行下标密集数组]\n  D --&gt; E[下游算子&lt;br/&gt;按 sel 读列]\n  E --&gt; F[延迟物化&lt;br/&gt;需要时才按 sel 抓列]\n  D --&gt; G[继续合并&lt;br/&gt;AND 取交集 / OR 取并集]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引擎 / 标准</th>\n<th>默认批大小</th>\n<th>选择结构</th>\n<th>关键事实</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MonetDB/X100</td>\n<td>~1000 值向量</td>\n<td>无独立 sel，过滤即重写向量</td>\n<td>CIDR 2005，向量驻留缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DuckDB</td>\n<td><code>STANDARD_VECTOR_SIZE = 2048</code></td>\n<td><code>SelectionVector</code>（<code>sel_t = uint32_t</code>）</td>\n<td>0.10（2024-02）默认由 1024 提升至 2048</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ClickHouse</td>\n<td><code>max_block_size</code> 约 65536 行</td>\n<td>无通用 sel，用过滤列 + 组合列</td>\n<td>块粒度大，靠大批量摊薄开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Arrow</td>\n<td>RecordBatch 长度灵活</td>\n<td><code>Filter</code> 语义输出索引/Take 数组</td>\n<td>计算内核以「选择内核」表达过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Velox（Meta）</td>\n<td>向量 ≤1024 行</td>\n<td><code>SelectivityVector</code>（位图）</td>\n<td>开源 C++ 执行库，位图 + 解码向量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键差异不在「有没有 SIMD」，而在<strong>过滤结果的表示</strong>：位图省内存、天然适合掩码运算；索引数组省下游解引用成本、可直接驱动 gather 与延迟物化。DuckDB、X100 选后者，Velox 的 <code>SelectivityVector</code> 选前者。本章后续内容（见 <a href=\"../memory-pipeline-vector/\">内存与向量流水线</a>）会把这一取舍推到缓存与物化层面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择向量的语义与数据结构\">选择向量的语义与数据结构</h2><p>选择向量的严格语义是「对平坦（flat）向量的下投影」：若向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 行、选择向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sel</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sel</span></span></span></span></span></span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素，则逻辑输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>out</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>sel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{out}[i] = v[\\text{sel}[i]]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">out</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]]</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\in [0, k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6986em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。最关键的性质是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sel</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sel</span></span></span></span></span></span> <strong>单调递增</strong>（由过滤的扫描顺序保证）。单调性让下游 gather 具备访存局部性——顺序索引比随机索引更易命中同一条 cache line，也让「交集」退化为线性归并而非哈希。DuckDB 因此在源码里显式区分普通选择向量与「保证有序的选择向量」，只对后者开启某些归并优化。</p>\n<p>选择向量与 <strong>NULL 语义</strong>必须分开表示：它只回答「这一行是否通过谓词」，不回答「值是否为 NULL」。<code>price &gt; 100</code> 在 <code>price IS NULL</code> 时应返回 NULL 而非 false，因此引擎还需独立的 validity 位图（DuckDB 的 <code>ValidityMask</code>）。三层结构是 <code>values[]</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 长）、<code>validity</code> 位图（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 位）、<code>sel[]</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 长）。正确做法是先算 validity 的 AND 再并入选择；若把 NULL 当 false 过滤，<code>NOT (price &gt; 100)</code> 会错误保留 NULL 行。</p>\n<p>选择向量还与<strong>向量编码</strong>相互作用。向量不只「平坦」一种形态：DuckDB 支持 <code>FLAT</code>、<code>CONSTANT</code>、<code>DICTIONARY</code>、<code>SEQUENCE</code>（DuckDB 文档 <em>Vector</em> 一节）。<code>CONSTANT</code> 表示整批同值（如 <code>region = &#39;EU&#39;</code> 的常量右操作数），无需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 份拷贝即可比较；<code>DICTIONARY</code> 取数需一次查表。选择向量必须叠在编码之上且<strong>不能打破编码</strong>：对 <code>CONSTANT</code> 做选择结果仍是 <code>CONSTANT</code>，否则零拷贝操作会膨胀成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次拷贝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批大小选择-寄存器-缓存与吞吐\">批大小选择：寄存器、缓存与吞吐</h2><p>批大小不是越大越好，也不是越小越好，它同时被三个硬约束夹击：<strong>SIMD 寄存器宽度</strong>、<strong>cache 容量</strong>、<strong>掩码位宽</strong>。</p>\n<p>寄存器侧：AVX2 的 256 位 YMM 一次比较 8 个 <code>int32</code>，AVX-512 的 512 位 ZMM 一次 16 个；批大小应是宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的整数倍，否则尾部走标量。DuckDB 把默认值从 1024 提到 2048（DuckDB 0.10.0 发布说明，2024-02-13）正因 2048 在 AVX-512 上是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16 \\times 128</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span></span></span></span></span>、在 AVX2 上是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8 \\times 256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>，都能整除主流宽度并被编译器完全展开。</p>\n<p>cache 侧：设算子访问 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 列、每值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 字节、批大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，工作集为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\cdot n \\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。2048 行同时读 4 个 8 字节列时约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2048</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\times 2048 \\times 8 = 64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2048</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> KiB，越过 L1（32–48 KiB）但远在 L2（512 KiB–2 MiB）内；而 ClickHouse 量级的 65536 行工作集达数 MiB，必须依赖 L3 甚至内存带宽。</p>\n<p>吞吐可粗写为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>row</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>simd</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(n) = \\dfrac{n \\cdot c_{\\text{row}}}{\\lceil n/W \\rceil \\cdot c_{\\text{simd}} + c_{\\text{overhead}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0575em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1215em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">simd</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">row</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>row</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{row}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">row</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 逐行标量成本、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>simd</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{simd}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">simd</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 单条向量指令成本、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 每批固定开销）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≫</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\gg W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 时逼近宽度比，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 同阶时固定开销主导、退化为标量。这就是 2048 的定量依据——<strong>足够大到覆盖固定开销，又足够小到留在 L2 内</strong>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>批大小是架构刻度而非普适最优。Neumann（VLDB 2011，《Efficiently Compiling Efficient Query Plans for Modern Hardware》）走相反方向，把解释开销压到零；Umbra（CIDR 2020）进一步推到「向量化负责过滤/连接、编译负责表达式求值」的混合形态。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"simd-过滤通路-比较-掩码与压缩\">SIMD 过滤通路：比较、掩码与压缩</h2><p>过滤通路的四步在任何引擎里都成立，差别只在用哪条指令：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>向量化比较</strong>：把谓词拆成「列 vs 列」或「列 vs 常量」的比较原语。<strong>常量比较是最大的一类优化</strong>——右操作数是 <code>CONSTANT</code> 向量时无需比较两列，可广播常量到寄存器再比较。</li>\n<li><strong>掩码生成</strong>：AVX2 下比较指令直接写回全 0 / 全 1 的向量（<code>_mm256_cmpgt_epi32</code> 对每个 lane 产出 <code>0xFFFFFFFF</code> 或 <code>0</code>）；AVX-512 写入 k 掩码寄存器（对 <code>int32</code> 宽 16 位），是硬件级位图。</li>\n<li><strong>压缩为索引</strong>：把 lane 掩码转成下标数组。AVX2 无直接指令，通常「抽取掩码整数 → 循环 <code>_tzcnt</code> 取最低位 → 累加 <code>i*W + bit</code>」或用 8 位掩码查表。AVX-512 有 <code>_mm512_mask_compressstoreu_epi32</code>，一条指令把选中 lane 连续写入数组——这是 AVX-512 在过滤场景的关键增益（指令语义见 Intel Intrinsics Guide，<code>https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/docs/intrinsics-guide/index.html</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>合并多谓词</strong>：<code>AND</code> 对应两选择向量的交集，<code>OR</code> 对应并集，均可在索引递增的前提下线性完成。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个可直接对照的 AVX2 过滤骨架（伪代码，展示通路形状）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i += 8) {&#10;  __m256i cmp = _mm256_cmpgt_epi32(loadu(col + i), bound);&#10;  int bits = _mm256_movemask_ps(_mm256_castsi256_ps(cmp));&#10;  while (bits) { sel[k++] = i + __builtin_ctz(bits); bits &amp;= bits - 1; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  __m256i cmp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _mm256_cmpgt_epi32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i), bound);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _mm256_movemask_ps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_mm256_castsi256_ps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cmp));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (bits) { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> __builtin_ctz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bits); bits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>骨架里没有分支预测失败：内层 <code>while</code> 的迭代次数取决于选择性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，但每条向量的比较恒为一条指令。<strong>过滤路径的逐行分支被消除了</strong>——这是 SIMD 比较相对 <code>if (row &gt; bound)</code> 的结构优势。代价转移到第 3 步：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时压缩近乎全量复制、收益趋零，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时压缩循环几乎不执行、收益趋满。收益区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>speedup</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{speedup}(\\sigma) \\approx \\dfrac{W}{1 + \\sigma(W-1)/\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">speedup</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为压缩吞吐系数）表明：<strong>低选择性时收益最大</strong>（逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 倍），高选择性时被压缩成本吃掉。这正是选择向量摆在架构中心的原因——它把过滤产出从「已复制的数据」降级为「便宜的索引」。</p>\n<p>选择向量还有第二个收益：<strong>延迟物化（late materialization）</strong>。过滤阶段只处理谓词涉及的窄列（如 <code>int32</code> 的 id），宽列（<code>VARCHAR</code>、<code>BLOB</code>）不读；等真正需要输出或聚合时再按 <code>sel</code> 逐行抓取。Abadi 等人（ICDE 2007，《Materialization Strategies in a Column-Oriented DBMS》）量化了这一点：把选择向量推迟物化，在大宽表扫描上可减少数倍的 I/O 与解压开销。常见实现形态是「id 列表 + 回表」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算子契约与-null-语义\">算子契约与 NULL 语义</h2><p>选择向量不是过滤算子的私有细节，而是<strong>算子间的公开契约</strong>，核心是三条规则：<strong>可空表示</strong>——无选择向量即「全量」，实现上要显式区分「恒等选择」与「空选择」，不能靠空指针表达；<strong>保持编码不变</strong>——对 <code>CONSTANT</code> 或 <code>DICTIONARY</code> 向量施加 <code>sel</code>，输出仍是同种编码（<code>CONSTANT</code> 甚至可完全省略），否则会把零拷贝操作放大；<strong>NULL 与选择正交</strong>——谓词在 NULL 上返回 NULL 而非 false，实现上等价于先做 validity 的 AND 再合并进 <code>sel</code>。</p>\n<p>第三条在 <code>NOT</code> 与 <code>OR</code> 上尤其容易出错。考虑 <code>region &lt;&gt; &#39;EU&#39;</code>：<code>region</code> 为 NULL 的行必须保持 NULL（在 <code>WHERE</code> 中被过滤掉，但在 <code>SELECT region &lt;&gt; &#39;EU&#39;</code> 中输出 NULL）；若把 NULL 折叠成 false，<code>NOT</code> 会把 NULL 行错误保留。这就是「三值逻辑不能靠布尔选择向量单独承载」的原因——也是 DuckDB 把 <code>ValidityMask</code> 与 <code>SelectionVector</code> 分成两个类型、Velox 让 <code>SelectivityVector</code> 只承载「行是否被选中」的原因。</p>\n<p>可迁移的经验是：<strong>把选择向量当成公开 API 而非内部优化</strong>。DuckDB 的 <code>Vector::Slice()</code> 与 <code>SelectionVector</code> 的交互、Velox 的 <code>DecodedVector</code> 把编码与选择解耦（Velox 文档 <em>Vectors</em>，<code>https://facebookincubator.github.io/velox/develop/vectors.html</code>），共同做法都是让选择向量在算子边界上显式传递，任何算子都不假设输入平坦且未过滤——由此换来算子可自由组合，而不必为每种输入形态写特例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>批处理模型用「定长同类型向量」取代逐行执行。X100（CIDR 2005）以约千行量级向量奠定该模型，DuckDB 把默认批大小定为 <code>STANDARD_VECTOR_SIZE = 2048</code>（0.10，2024-02）。</li>\n<li>选择向量是单调递增的 <code>uint32</code> 下标数组，语义为对平坦向量的下投影；DuckDB 用 <code>SelectionVector</code> 表达，容量上界 <code>MAX_VECTOR_SIZE = 2048</code>。</li>\n<li>批大小由 SIMD 宽度（AVX2 8×int32 / AVX-512 16×int32）、cache 工作集（约 64 KiB 落在 L1/L2 之间）与每批固定开销共同决定。</li>\n<li>SIMD 过滤通路 = 比较 → 掩码 → 压缩 → 合并；AVX-512 的 <code>_mm512_mask_compressstoreu_epi32</code> 把压缩降为一条指令。</li>\n<li>过滤收益随选择性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 变化，低选择性逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 倍、高选择性被压缩成本吃掉；选择向量的价值在于把高选择性的坏情况降级为廉价索引。</li>\n<li>选择向量是算子间的公开契约：可空表示、保持向量编码、与 NULL 语义正交，缺一都会引入静默的错误结果。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SIMD 通路与选择向量：批处理数据模型","id":"simd-通路与选择向量-批处理数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"选择向量的语义与数据结构","id":"选择向量的语义与数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"批大小选择：寄存器、缓存与吞吐","id":"批大小选择-寄存器-缓存与吞吐"},{"level":2,"text":"SIMD 过滤通路：比较、掩码与压缩","id":"simd-过滤通路-比较-掩码与压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"算子契约与 NULL 语义","id":"算子契约与-null-语义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"执行模型选型、混合流水线与迁移落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/execution-model-evolution/execution-model-selection-migration"},"next":{"title":"向量化 filter、聚合与 hash join 算子实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/column-operators-simd/vectorized-operator-implementation"}}